{"id":"625954","name":"无米炒饭","author":"⁶₆ZQY₆⁶","authorId":"12229186","desc":"","cover":"images/625954/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"午餐肉切丁、花菜切碎、青豆和玉米粒准备好、鸡蛋两颗打散。","img":"images/625954/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鸡蛋和花菜混合搅拌均匀。","img":"images/625954/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅放油，蒜爆香。","img":"images/625954/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入玉米粒、青豆粒、午餐肉丁，翻炒下。","img":"images/625954/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把花菜进蛋液加入一起翻炒。","img":"images/625954/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒出颗粒感后加点蚝油。","img":"images/625954/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加点生抽和盐。","img":"images/625954/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"继续翻炒。","img":"images/625954/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盛出来，开吃！美味营养又低脂！","img":"images/625954/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}